，右侧是更小字号的产品描述。标签底部是一幅描绘着河边小屋和松林的风景画。整个标签使用了红色、紫色和白色作为主色调，并结合了手写体和无衬线字体。"}],"criterion":{"pass":"针对瓶身主标签文字，仅判断几何贴合：文字符合标签所在瓶面的实际曲率与视角。不强求参考图相同形变，不添加未要求的磨损、褶皱或遮挡。","fail":"瓶身主标签文字在几何贴合方面与该载体明显矛盾；不因普通文字内容错误、颜色或绝对位置扣本项。","semantic_policy":"按语义而非字面评分；同义表述及不改变身份/含义的大小写、空格、标点差异不扣分。主体、数值、单位、条件、否定和对应关系必须保留。普通位置、字体、颜色归D3。"},"evidence_needed":"观察该处文字及其实际载体；只检验本项物理属性，文字读不清不自动判载体失败。","semantic_atom":{"subject":"瓶身主标签文字","predicate":"几何贴合","value":"文字符合标签所在瓶面的实际曲率与视角"},"origin_check_ids":["textcanvasbench_000477.d4.012"],"atomicity_review":{"action":"split","reason":"两个物理标签可分别失败，按实例拆开同一属性。"},"check_id":"textcanvasbench_000477.d4a2.017"}}],"table_fact_examples":[{"component":"completeness","requirement":"Supply Voltage Vcc行参数是否为Vcc，范围4.75至5.25 V","targets":["text_13.item_31","text_13.item_32","text_13.item_33","text_13.item_34","text_13.item_35","text_13.item_36"],"quantifier":"global","source":[{"field":"text_blocks.text_13","quote":"Supply Voltage Vcc | Vcc | 4.75 | 5.0 | 5.25 | V"}],"criterion":{"pass":"生成图中该行依次显示Supply Voltage Vcc, Vcc, 4.75, 5.0, 5.25, V","fail":"缺失行、符号错误或数值/单位错误"},"evidence_needed":"观察实际生成文字及该命题涉及的对象、关系或载体。","check_id":"textcanvasbench_000043.d4.057"},{"component":"completeness","requirement":"Response Latency行参数是否为Td，典型45ms，最大60ms","targets":["text_13.item_37","text_13.item_38","text_13.item_39","text_13.item_40","text_13.item_41"],"quantifier":"global","source":[{"field":"text_blocks.text_13","quote":"Response Latency | Td |  | 45 | 60 | ms"}],"criterion":{"pass":"生成图中该行依次显示Response Latency, Td, 45, 60, ms","fail":"缺失行、符号错误或数值/单位错误"},"evidence_needed":"观察实际生成文字及该命题涉及的对象、关系或载体。","check_id":"textcanvasbench_000043.d4.058"}],"field_legend":{"source":"Input passage supporting the requirement","targets":"Text items or regions to identify","requirement":"One independently assessable semantic requirement","criterion":"Conditions for semantic satisfaction or violation","evidence_needed":"What must later be observed in the generated image, not an observation already made"},"caption_en":"D4 specification examples illustrating semantic facts and relations. Table facts retain subject–attribute–value bindings, while other checks address intent, text–image associations, and procedural relations. A separate physical-scene example illustrates carrier integration. The displayed checks are excerpts from variable-length checklists.","samples":[{"sample_id":"textcanvasbench_000043","domain":"信息图类","reference_image":"reference_images/textcanvasbench_000043.jpg","prompt_en":"This image is a technical specification datasheet. The top displays the company name \"AERO-LOGIC SYSTEMS,\" department, and document number. The main title \"THREE-AXIS FLIGHT CONTROL ACTUATOR LOGIC & OPERATIONAL DYNAMICS\" is centered in the largest, bold font. The page is divided into various functional sections by headers with blue background banners. The first section, \"CONNECTION DIAGRAM & INPUT/OUTPUT MAPPING,\" shows a pin connection diagram on the left and descriptive text along with a text box containing \"CONTROL MOMENT TRANSFER EQUATIONS\" on the right. The second section, \"AERODYNAMIC CONTROL SURFACE SCHEMATIC,\" contains a top-down schematic of an aircraft, using leader lines to label parts like \"LEFT AILERON\" and \"LEFT SPOILER,\" and indicating pitch, roll, and yaw axes. The lower half is split into two columns: the left column features a \"FUNCTIONAL TRUTH TABLE\" for different flight states, with a note below; the right column contains a \"DYNAMIC & ELECTRICAL LIMITS\" table showing parameter metrics, followed by an \"ABSOLUTE MAXIMUM RATINGS\" section with a red background banner, listing maximum limits and a warning message in red text. A line of fine print at the bottom center provides company contact information.","generation_format_instructions":{"cn":"以下必须文字按独立表达区域组织。区域编号、方括号中的类型说明以及表格分隔符“|”均为输入结构标记，不作为画面文字。表格内同一行的内容从左至右对应各列，换行表示下一行；重复文字按所在位置分别呈现。区域的视觉布局遵循上述描述。\n画面文字以所附 text_blocks 的 items.content 为准。描述语言不改变画面文字语言：逐字保留原语言、原拼写、数字、标点及真实双语内容，不翻译、不音译、不补充括号释义，不修正文案。描述与清单不一致时采用清单。区域编号、文字编号、JSON 标点和转义表示仅用于组织输入，不要画出；解码字符串中的换行并按指定区域和顺序排版。","en":"The required text below is grouped by independent visual region. Region IDs, bracketed type labels, and the table separator \"|\" are input structure markers, not visible lettering. Within each table, cells on a line occupy successive columns from left to right; each new line is the next row. Preserve repeated text at its respective locations. Follow the visual layout described above.\nUse the attached text_blocks items.content as the authoritative visible lettering. The language of the description does not change the language of the lettering. Preserve the original language, spelling, numbers, punctuation, and genuine bilingual content verbatim. Do not translate, transliterate, add parenthetical meanings, or correct the wording. If the prose conflicts with the inventory, use the inventory. Region IDs, text IDs, JSON syntax, and escape notation only organize the input and must not be rendered. Decode newlines inside strings and lay out each entry in its specified region and order.","table_cell_escaping":"Cells containing pipes, quotes or newlines are JSON strings; decode escapes as literal cell content. Region labels and separators are metadata."},"text_blocks":[{"id":"text_1","label":"页眉左侧","type":"header","source_text_ids":["text_1","text_3"],"source_region_ids":["region_14"],"items":[{"source_text_id":"text_1","content":"AERO-LOGIC SYSTEMS","role":"公司名称","reference_position_legacy":"顶部左侧","reference_typography_legacy":"深蓝色，大写，粗体"},{"source_text_id":"text_3","content":"FLIGHT DYNAMICS DIVISION","role":"部门名称","reference_position_legacy":"顶部左侧，公司名称下方","reference_typography_legacy":"黑色，小字号，常规字重"}],"formatted_content":"AERO-LOGIC SYSTEMS\nFLIGHT DYNAMICS DIVISION","mapping_status":"two_pass_model_visual_audit_not_human","geometry_status":"regrouped_reference_boxes_not_rebuilt"},{"id":"text_2","label":"页眉右侧","type":"header","source_text_ids":["text_2","text_4"],"source_re